OL,3,GNEWSAFive men deny operating rural meth
OL,4,Alab
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive men have denied conspiring to
OL,7,Foperate a meth lab from remote farmland
OL,8,Fin Warwickshire.
OL,10,FIt is alleged the men were part of a
OL,11,Fcrime group manufacturing the class A
OL,12,Fdrug methamphetamine near the hamlet of
OL,13,FFurnace End.
OL,15,FJudge Rhona Campbell was told by
OL,16,Fdefence barristers at the hearing at
OL,17,FWarwick Crown Court on Thursday that
OL,18,Fall five defendants denied any
OL,19,Fknowledge of drugs production, with one
OL,20,Fclaiming to be a chef and another to
OL,21,Fhave been involved in construction
OL,22,Fwork.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
