OL,3,GNEWSAFive men deny operating rural meth
OL,4,Alab
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe case was adjourned, with a trial
OL,7,Fset for the same court on 15 February.
OL,8,FAll five men remain remanded in
OL,9,Fcustody.
